            <Text style={{ marginTop: 4, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 10.2, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.54)', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>通信 → Firewall → 规则 → 结果；命中规则和阻断位置写进事件。</Text>
